    "Bundles FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib and bmx; optionally downloads yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp and Parakeet at runtime. Each component is distributed under its own license — see the Licenses folder in the source repository for bundled components' full terms." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the license for Aagedal Media Converter.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bundles FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib und bmx; Lädt optional yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp und Parakeet zur Laufzeit herunter. Jede Komponente wird unter einer eigenen Lizenz vertrieben. Die vollständigen Bedingungen der gebündelten Komponenten finden Sie im Ordner „Lizenzen“ im Quell-Repository."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Paquetes FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib y bmx; opcionalmente descarga yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp y Parakeet en tiempo de ejecución. Cada componente se distribuye bajo su propia licencia; consulte la carpeta Licencias en el repositorio de origen para conocer los términos completos de los componentes incluidos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Offres groupées FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib et bmx ; télécharge en option yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp et Parakeet au moment de l'exécution. Chaque composant est distribué sous sa propre licence. Consultez le dossier Licences dans le référentiel source pour connaître les conditions complètes des composants regroupés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Pacchetti FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib e bmx; scarica opzionalmente yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp e Parakeet in fase di runtime. Ogni componente è distribuito con la propria licenza: vedere la cartella Licenze nel repository di origine per i termini completi dei componenti in bundle."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "FFmpeg、mpv、tesseract、asdcplib、および bmx をバンドルします。オプションで、実行時に yt-dlp、Deno、rclone、whisper.cpp、および Parakeet をダウンロードします。各コンポーネントは独自のライセンスに基づいて配布されます。バンドルされたコンポーネントの完全な条件については、ソース リポジトリの Licenses フォルダを参照してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib 및 bmx를 번들로 제공합니다. 선택적으로 런타임에 yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp 및 Parakeet를 다운로드합니다. 각 구성 요소는 자체 라이선스에 따라 배포됩니다. 번들 구성 요소의 전체 약관은 소스 저장소의 라이선스 폴더를 참조하세요."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inkluderer FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib og bmx; laster eventuelt ned yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp og Parakeet ved kjøring. Hver komponent distribueres under sin egen lisens — se Licenses-mappen i kildekoderepositoriet for de fullstendige vilkårene for inkluderte komponenter."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Pacotes FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib e bmx; opcionalmente, baixa yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp e Parakeet em tempo de execução. Cada componente é distribuído sob sua própria licença — consulte a pasta Licenças no repositório de origem para obter os termos completos dos componentes incluídos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "捆绑包 FFmpeg、mpv、tesseract、asdcplib 和 bmx；可选择在运行时下载 yt-dlp、Deno、rclone、whisper.cpp 和 Parakeet。每个组件都根据自己的许可证进行分发 - 请参阅源存储库中的许可证文件夹以获取捆绑组件的完整条款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundles FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib, bmx and rclone; optionally downloads yt-dlp, Deno, whisper.cpp and Parakeet at runtime. Each component is distributed under its own license. Bundled license notices are available below; see the source repository for component details." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bundles FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib, bmx und rclone; Lädt optional yt-dlp, Deno, whisper.cpp und Parakeet zur Laufzeit herunter. Jede Komponente wird unter einer eigenen Lizenz vertrieben. Die gebündelten Lizenzhinweise sind unten verfügbar. Einzelheiten zu den Komponenten finden Sie im Quell-Repository."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Paquetes FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib, bmx y rclone; opcionalmente descarga yt-dlp, Deno, whisper.cpp y Parakeet en tiempo de ejecución. Cada componente se distribuye bajo su propia licencia. Los avisos de licencia incluidos están disponibles a continuación; consulte el repositorio de origen para obtener detalles sobre los componentes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Offres groupées FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib, bmx et rclone ; télécharge éventuellement yt-dlp, Deno, whisper.cpp et Parakeet au moment de l'exécution. Chaque composant est distribué sous sa propre licence. Les avis de licence groupés sont disponibles ci-dessous ; consultez le référentiel source pour les détails des composants."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Pacchetti FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib, bmx e rclone; scarica opzionalmente yt-dlp, Deno, whisper.cpp e Parakeet in fase di runtime. Ogni componente è distribuito con la propria licenza. Gli avvisi sulla licenza in bundle sono disponibili di seguito; vedere il repository di origine per i dettagli dei componenti."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "FFmpeg、mpv、tesseract、asdcplib、bmx、および rclone をバンドルします。オプションで、実行時に yt-dlp、Deno、whisper.cpp、および Parakeet をダウンロードします。各コンポーネントは独自のライセンスに基づいて配布されます。バンドルされたライセンス通知は以下から入手できます。コンポーネントの詳細については、ソース リポジトリを参照してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib, bmx 및 rclone 번들; 선택적으로 런타임 시 yt-dlp, Deno, whisper.cpp 및 Parakeet를 다운로드합니다. 각 구성 요소는 자체 라이선스에 따라 배포됩니다. 번들 라이센스 공지는 아래에서 확인할 수 있습니다. 구성 요소 세부 정보는 소스 저장소를 참조하세요."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
